            - paragraph [ref=e75]:
              - text: When writing functional or integration tests with Aspire, managing the
              - link "AppHost" [ref=e76] [cursor=pointer]:
                - /url: /get-started/app-host/
              - text: instance efficiently is crucial. The AppHost represents the full application environment and can be costly to create and tear down. This article explains how to manage the AppHost instance in your Aspire tests.
