              - text: For writing tests with Aspire, you use the
              - link "Aspire.Hosting.Testing" [ref=e78] [cursor=pointer]:
                - /url: https://www.nuget.org/packages/Aspire.Hosting.Testing
              - text: NuGet package which contains some helper classes to manage the AppHost instance in your tests.
