            - paragraph [ref=e171]: By capturing the AppHost in a field when the test run is started, you can access it in each test without the need to recreate it, decreasing the time it takes to run the tests. Then, when the test run completes, the AppHost is disposed, which cleans up any resources that were created during the test run, such as containers.
